  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Erin Sullivan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T12:37:48-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T12:37:52-05:00",
      "duration": 30,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, so I'm calling because a neighbor keeps leaving trash bags at the corner by me, not on pickup day, just whenever, and it's been a few weeks, and the bags get ripped open and stuff blows around, and I'm also wondering how I'd request a replacement, because my recycling bin got knocked over and cracked in the middle of all that, and I've been home sorting old photographs into albums so I'm out there a lot and I see it, and the location is 233 Memorial Boulevard, that corner right there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T12:38:22-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, let me make sure I have that. Bags being dumped at the corner of 233 Memorial Boulevard, and your recycling bin is cracked and needs replacing. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T12:38:32-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T12:38:34-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "For the replacement bin, I'll put in a request with your address. Is the bin the one the city gave you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T12:38:42-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the blue one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T12:38:44-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. I'll send the dumping report to the crew too, so they can check the corner. Do you want a callback number on it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T12:38:53-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, it's 401-555-0168."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T12:38:55-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0168. All set, Erin. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T12:38:58-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Thanks."
    }
  ],
